  "notes": "BS Elementary Education (Dothan campus), College of Education and Behavioral Sciences. TEP admission (2.75 GPA) and passing the Praxis Elementary Multiple Subjects required; ELE 3362 requires MTH 2251 or 2252. RED 3310, RED 3320, RED 4465, RED 4483, and EDU 4478 are printed '(SEMESTER)' - full-semester courses. Minimum 2.75 GPA overall and in the major to graduate. Official Troy University Dothan sequence publishes 15 terms: Terms 1-4 per year in Years 1-2 (Troy's 5-term calendar) and professional Blocks 1a/1b/2a/2b (Year 3), 3a/3b and Block 4 (Year 4). extended=True set per the 2026-10-05 coordinator extension rule for officially published block/term structures. Coordinator fix 2026-10-06: verified against the official source; validated under build.py gates extended per coordinator decision 2026-10-05 (BACKLOG-18 wave 32), documented in build.py comments.",
